  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have been the butt of many a joke but you have become quite adept at suffering with grace.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you are forced to make a Will save against a mind-affecting effect with a duration longer than 2 rounds you may choose to automatically fail it. If this option is chosen, the effect’s duration is reduced by 2 rounds to a minimum of 2 rounds.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-feats#toc50\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
